<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH PX50 INDEX CLOSES UP 2.4 PTS AT 558.3.</title>
<headline>CZECH PX50 INDEX CLOSES UP 2.4 PTS AT 558.3.</headline>
<text>
<p>1500 GMT - The Prague Stock Exchange's PX50 index closes up 2.4 points, or 0.43 percent, at 558.3.</p>
<p>*Overall, 188 issues rise, 192 lose ground and 164 hold steady.</p>
<p>*Total volume very heavy at 2.5 million shares on turnover of 1.43 billion crowns.</p>
<p>-- Prague newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
